    <thead><tr><th>State</th><th>Locations listed</th><th>Cheapest location</th><th>Half of locations start at or below</th><th>Most expensive</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Florida</td><td>242</td><td><strong>$5.99/mo</strong>, Fort Walton Beach (Lewis Turner Blvd) <Src href={S.atmFl} /></td><td>about $10.50/mo</td><td>$69/mo</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Delaware</td><td>18</td><td><strong>$6.99/mo</strong>, Newark (Polly Drummond Shopping Center) <Src href={S.atmDe} /></td><td>$9.99/mo</td><td>$15.99/mo</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Texas</td><td>290</td><td><strong>$7.99/mo</strong>, Austin (605 W 9th Street) <Src href={S.atmTx} /></td><td>$11.99/mo</td><td>$59.99/mo</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Wyoming</td><td>6</td><td><strong>$7.99/mo</strong>, Cheyenne (South Greeley Hwy) <Src href={S.atmWy} /></td><td>$9.99/mo</td><td>$19.99/mo</td></tr>
      <tr><td>California</td><td>397</td><td><strong>$7.99/mo</strong>, at several locations including Anaheim, Fresno and Laguna Niguel <Src href={S.atmCa} /></td><td>$9.99/mo</td><td>$75/mo</td></tr>
      <tr><td>New York</td><td>99</td><td><strong>$8.99/mo</strong>, East Setauket, Glen Cove and Plainview (all Long Island) <Src href={S.atmNy} /></td><td>$11.99/mo</td><td>$84.99/mo</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p class="meta">Source: the "Starting from" price on each location card of Anytime Mailbox's state pages, checked November 23, 2026 (linked in each row). The middle and high columns use monthly prices only; one California location and three Brooklyn locations show only a yearly price ($149.99 to $399.99 a year) and are left out of those columns. "Starting from" is the location's cheapest plan; mail allowances and per-item fees differ by location, so open the location page before you sign up <Src href={S.atm} />.</p>

